<title>Response Scales in Voting Advice Applications: Do Different Designs Produce Different Outcomes?</title>
<meta name="citation_title" content="Response Scales in Voting Advice Applications: Do Different Designs Produce Different Outcomes?">
<meta name="citation_author" content="Rosema, M.">
<meta name="citation_author" content="Louwerse, T.">
<meta name="citation_publication_date" content="2016/10/24">
